  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 26 ('Forest Troll Fort (the live dungeon: forest trolls and their seerdoctors from th'): scene sg_troll_fort, 6 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Queen Verda last; every spot is the fork's."
    },
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Card: Global.Text 5708, 16380, icon 669 (the fork battle's own ids)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: the scene sg_troll_fort needs one native load with this roster. The fork's scene layout, not a captured one; local kinds take ids 14008*100+n; knockouts, score, coins and the level gate are the fork fights' (fights/14xxx.json); job XP is the battles' 50."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) 1 later group(s) of the fork come as waves at their own spots: the first when the guards are down, each next one when the one before is down or 16 s after it (the captured Frostfang battle's gap)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done when the boss falls; the boss waits, dormant, for the waves. The results follow the exit door, which opens with the main goal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Built by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/forest_troll_fort.json, its notes page and the fork battle; under the id (14008) quests name."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "rc-0137 prize wheel: fandom 'Forest Troll Fort' (revision 49339) lists one prize wheel per combat job and a 214-coin slot; any other job spins the items every job's wheel holds. Wizard: the wiki's 'Adept Wizard Long Cloak' is 'Adept Wizard Robe' in our record dungeons/forest_troll_fort.json."
    }
  ]
